Z||000005||The Fieromaster||06-24-2001||01:31 PM||||I love killing Honda's!  There is a Ford Probe that runs around here with a serious RICE disease!  He has a TURBO sticker on his car and its NOT turbocharged!  I love ripping on him! It was about a week ago that my buddy Keith and I (his 86 GT and my 85 GT fastback) ran up on him.  Well it was sad because we TORE him up!  Then we continued (at a light) to pop our heads out the sunroof and tell him "Nice turbo Probe" wow he was SALTY!  Hehe!<P>I guess when it comes to "rice" my quote fits tride and true...<P>"RACED THAT WRECKED BETTER"<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">   <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||10
